                                "sense_id": "d4ea47c3-a9ae-3167-ae11-de57e8ad5a61",
                                "text": "The University of Phoenix, a for-profit educational institution, has turned the traditional relationship between athletics and higher education on its head, reducing it to its commercially exploitive essence."
